---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';

const bodyHtml = `
<h2>What KSM is</h2>
<p>
  Kallus Strategic Management ("KSM") is a financial strategy consulting practice. KSM analyzes a
  client's financial position and produces written analysis, a stated priority and a prioritized
  roadmap. That analysis is advisory in nature and educational in purpose.
</p>

<h2>What KSM is not</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Not a lender or bank.</strong> KSM does not originate, fund, purchase or service loans, lines of credit, advances or any other extension of credit.</li>
  <li><strong>Not a loan broker or originator.</strong> KSM does not submit financing applications on a client's behalf, does not place clients with lenders, and does not receive compensation, commissions or referral fees from lenders or funding sources.</li>
  <li><strong>Not a credit repair organization.</strong> KSM does not dispute entries on consumer credit reports, does not contact credit bureaus on a client's behalf, and does not offer to improve or repair credit records, history or ratings.</li>
  <li><strong>Not a debt settlement, debt relief or debt management company.</strong> KSM does not negotiate with creditors, does not enroll clients in settlement or management programs, and does not hold, receive or disburse client funds.</li>
  <li><strong>Not a consumer reporting agency.</strong> KSM does not assemble, evaluate, furnish or sell consumer credit information or consumer reports as those terms are used under the Fair Credit Reporting Act.</li>
  <li><strong>Not an investment adviser, broker-dealer, accountant or law firm.</strong> KSM does not manage assets, recommend securities, prepare tax filings, perform audits or provide legal advice.</li>
</ul>

<h2>No guarantees</h2>
<p>
  KSM does not guarantee, promise or predict any financial outcome. This includes but is not limited to:
  approval or denial of any application for credit; interest rates, credit limits, terms or fees offered
  by any lender; changes to any credit score or credit report; savings, cost reductions or debt
  elimination; business revenue, profitability or valuation; or the availability of financing of any
  kind.
</p>
<p>
  Lending decisions are made solely by lenders according to their own underwriting criteria, which KSM
  does not control and cannot influence.
</p>

<h2>Illustrative content on this website</h2>
<p>
  Every score, percentage, metric, progress bar, profile dashboard, sample report, roadmap, walkthrough
  and scenario shown on this website is an <strong>illustrative example created for demonstration
  purposes</strong>. These figures do not represent an actual client, an actual engagement, an actual
  result, or any expected result. The numerical "profile position" shown in these examples is a
  presentational device and is not a credit score, a universal rating, or a prediction of any lending
  decision.
</p>

<h2>No testimonials or client claims</h2>
<p>
  This website does not display client testimonials, client logos, client counts, awards, certifications
  or performance statistics. Where a section of the site is designed to hold such material, it remains
  intentionally empty until KSM has authentic, substantiated content to place in it.
</p>

<h2>Not professional advice</h2>
<p>
  Nothing on this website — including the Insights articles — constitutes legal, tax, accounting,
  investment or lending advice, and nothing on it creates a client relationship. The content is general
  in nature and does not account for any individual's specific circumstances. Consult a qualified
  professional before acting on anything you read here.
</p>

<h2>Third-party references</h2>
<p>
  Any reference to a third-party company, product or website is for context only and does not imply
  endorsement, affiliation or sponsorship in either direction.
</p>

<h2>Questions</h2>
<p>
  Questions about these disclosures can be directed to
  <a href="mailto:motti@kallusstrategicmanagement.com">motti@kallusstrategicmanagement.com</a>.
</p>
`;
---

<LegalPage
  metaTitle="Disclosures | Kallus Strategic Management"
  metaDescription="What KSM is and is not: not a lender, broker, credit repair organization, debt settlement company or investment adviser. No guaranteed outcomes."
  path="/disclosures"
  eyebrow="Disclosures"
  title="What KSM is, what KSM is not, and what it cannot promise."
  lede="This page is deliberately blunt. A financial practice that is vague about its own limits is telling you something."
  updated="August 2026"
  bodyHtml={bodyHtml}
/>
